<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24524" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-vŏlo</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. n. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a.</i>, <i>to fly
				between</i> or <i>among</i> (post-Aug.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, of birds, <i><span class="en">Col. 8, 10,
				1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ille recens oculis intervolat Idmon,</span>”
				<i>flits before</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Fl. 5, 27</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">medias intervolat urbes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2,
					614</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hasta auras,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 2, 539</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
